<title>ANTIGUA: CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-RED STRIPE CUP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>ST JOHN'S, Antigua 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of four-day Red Stripe Cup cricket matches that ended on Monday.</p>
<p>In St George's, Grenada (third day): Barbados 161 and 167, Windward Islands 166 and 111 (Ottis Gibson 3-37). Barbados won by 51 runs.</p>
<p>In St John's (fourth day): Leeward Islands 352, Trinidad and Tobago 26-2. Rain prevented play on final day. Match abandoned as draw.</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, lost, drawn, no decision, points):</p>
<p> Barbados			 3    3    0    0    0    48</p>
<p> Jamaica			  3    1    0    1    1    28</p>
<p> Trinidad and Tobago	  3    1    1    0    1    20</p>
<p> Leeward Islands		3    0    0    1    2    12</p>
<p> Windward Islands	     3    0    3    0    0    10</p>
<p> Guyana			   3    0    1    0    2     8</p>
<p>(Note: windwards earned 10 points for two games which they led on first innings but were beaten).</p>
</text>
